 team up with the free SSR hero Molly.\u003cbr\u003eTogether, you\u0026#39;ll set out on a joyful adventure, spark the fire of hope, and rebuild a cozy home on the frozen frontier!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e[Game Features]\u003cbr\u003e◆Rebuild \u0026amp; Restore: Easy Progress\u003cbr\u003eWarmth begins with a single spark. Fire up the furnace to melt the snow and reclaim the land! Manage your people and resources to build a bustling, welcoming town!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e◆Idle \u0026amp; Earn: Constant Rewards\u003cbr\u003eSend your heroes out with one tap, then come back to a pile of resources ready for your next big upgrade, all stress-free.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e◆Tap \u0026amp; Play: Instant Fun\u003cbr\u003eGo ice fishing for rare catches or uncover hidden treasures beneath the snow. Perfect for quick, fun sessions anytime!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e◆Plan \u0026amp; Pair: Heroic Combos\u003cbr\u003eAll heroes share the same level, so you can upgrade and swap without the grind. Mix and match their skills for ultimate combos!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e◆Unite \u0026amp; Triumph: Shared Success\u003cbr\u003eJoin an alliance to heal faster, grow stronger, and explore further. Together, we share the chill and the cheer!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eReady to thrive in the frost? Download Whiteout Survival now — a perfect survival experience blending teamwork, idle fun, and smart strategy!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e[Follow Us]\u003cbr\u003eOfficial Website: https://whiteoutsurvival.centurygames.com\u003cbr\u003eFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/WhiteoutSurvival\u003cbr\u003eDiscord: https://discord.gg/whiteoutsurvival\u003cbr\u003eYouTube: https://www.youtube.com/@WhiteoutSurvivalOfficial\u003cbr\u003eTikTok: https://www.tiktok.com/@whiteoutsurvivalofficial\u003cbr\u003eX: https://x.com/WOS_Global\u003cbr\u003eInstagram: https://www.instagram.com/whiteoutsurvival\u003cbr\u003eThreads: https://www.threads.com/@whiteoutsurvival"],"Century Games PTE. LTD.","100,000,000+",null,"",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/p1Xi2t8q9BBGBtrpuoKE41izAa1uynOfyA2OUcpl_pqEfefqh7tbpPKx--LQlEkcKuPjBhX_l8AuiyTTJWD_"],null,[72,111,177,255]],null,["Rated for 16+",[null,2,[366,512],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/djaflVB_tFGRjZlfs-xrcdSPeI_CUG3TTewlYuSFjq1tsNXxb4aZqAq0uMFzUtiZI_R65RtDyr4Zt2vt"]],null,[null,"Users Interact, In-Game Purchases (Includes Random Items)"],[null,"\u003ca href\u003d\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\u003dappgame_ratings\"\u003eLearn more\u003c/a\u003e"],1,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/UAlGNLgnQRVs-XrK_mUGJw1h_nlO1Ykv0jZK-YoRrRYIGIWmRdE_CCPB7U34jAiz4xLWUAqQ5Me7Daq7N_8"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\u003dappgame_ratings"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,"IDR",""]],null,[null,"Buy"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\u003dcom.gof.global\u0026rdid\u003dcom.gof.global\u0026feature\u003dmd\u0026offerId"]],null,["CAE\u003d"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],["Install"],null,["CgYKBENBRT0\u003d"]]]],[2],null,[1,1,0],["Rp 17.000 - Rp 1.999.000 per item",[0]],{"101":[null,[[null,2,[1242,2208],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/oK9TSIzS6PGKCV7FAQgxVfsrsd0Zq9hdsiFnHtmRvhml3bf8sTVUITQUABnaT8BwVOnLRX28wTmCq9OI9MXA"]],[null,2,[1242,2208],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OqnriyjEHATMVbRz8H7eEKeZwePUwdDhOAYJCTsYNN6RqpC-mihCQY-xkjPMJgai10w0NQZmlHQvrKqTHyUI"]],[null,2,[1242,2208],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/tXAHB1NV4iPOyB_XuNGt6DaYbqIFuHHyqy7yoZloTTUR1YVg-nev6iT25vQOUtnMrykA5Qhf1vM3V7JkqYrZ3w"]],[null,2,[1242,2208],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/udP-y6FptQLrpvQjFfUrJjXxbU5nxMviXDs4C9htVR5L6X6si2qaGskXSYRskOmWR8Qtn8T-drg185qVjY-T3Q"]],[null,2,[1242,2208],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/gEd0lXyOYvQg5qJBHz4B7PgKlAIk2SeGzcXvshYjP0ysR