732],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/JrAozVOvAmKm0HKtOZg-1pfSRjOraUpLyZjGgEQIK_LgNcf_yLx-DZpQZ_S3ymjy9WrqDk_OGdGc9nPYQoKpDw"]],[null,2,[2048,2732],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/ZJ-5N_HFLc0gUZMILahq87Qi-TUV78FL7UYqSi8BhIdFnyIZ0F8Hmg4ww88GRx2QyuM_UZfvHWKVddGsQ4x_cIw"]],[null,2,[2048,2732],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/tWOEAVZRIC3b7IFSxtf2_seehJc5-Nf0awsp5SKxCEY996_OYo6tR6R8dC_2ssgw895diR9h3dMc8T1o9hE1VA"]],[null,2,[2048,2732],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Zd_eKgjthg9GyClKkPbq6KBvScPkLK0qwxsmgd6NhJSM0rK7uaFspVhRXnOLD6KkPjIJGUVIOw_8oYQznT8_Obg"]],[null,2,[2048,2732],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/PJUM3Bo4aIXx3z4VVPasGpSz0dyn5SYhsq1_wHigjOUr-U2Q37MUoQbFV3ohfmzSmGDmW4Tto_mHfNie3300O4o"]],[null,2,[2048,2732],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/2B_2hNaLSTvIOPUqaRpcUSswu_RfsFZ92SLaUiFJ1SDIt4l9_ta6_x5ZjQsDIGcznnWFbSnPMHK93P-rHZ8DZQ"]],[null,2,[1242,2208],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/LITwi--lIvdHikyhC7dPs02Gmeod3UTVCWF-7MbMUPVPO9IMxoPmXEMkjqHTfOVnNzIFRTGKVBkl5vUGbA_R"]],[null,2,[1242,2208],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/rLOyiyPsr5G44nsiqbzARxAZEuAzn5YGrNzduGJyrMFmzZ6bvACEBp7eolm2fuS8IkiK2pE3b1ejuyEu4tozpqA"]],[null,2,[1242,2208],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/w6DhbxmFWbAJpKnIP7IcLeXVCnZIC7o0pwm1PEG5L1qB-I9xLLihTI-o6py8ZBwZ8hOHv0kTGJLYtX-LhIUc"]]],"Fishing Clash: Sport Simulator",["4.8",4.8069406],"Simulation",null,null,[null,[[0,"IDR",""]],null,[null,"Buy"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\u003dcom.tensquaregames.letsfish2\u0026rdid\u003dcom.tensquaregames.letsfish2\u0026feature\u003dmd\u0026offerId"]],null,["CAE\u003d"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,"/store/apps/details?id\u003dcom.tensquaregames.letsfish2"]],["\u003d"],[[[null,null,"Q-zAhVKzlSY",[null,null,"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Q-zAhVKzlSY?vq\u003dlarge\u0026rel\u003d0\u0026autohide\u003d1\u0026showinfo\u003d0"],"yt:movie:Q-zAhVKzlSY",null,null,null,null,"AXH1ezldzS4ql0Mgg2zNK4zUrpa38uJOcLW-FV9jd6Rek9OACtf-7be_B2WqZ6VvdxFiP4WUlvxpjVd0QTzNbHVzw4YgFaCyrjJVEOhtUpWBaL91M2WK7Gx64rBIBU7ulS1v01arsh2IVJrnqUuQAGo-mTQRxcvnMOkHl61zP3lYIz8yrWezW5WEB7kvpdrvRnYDEePVCZYasrZz_oinqR8wm4OD2U1ViH2K2g3X_W2EN9XEY8mkC-gbhbvwQe_xrfnUp_38AxnI42GYB8L46H6hZ7ARDcVLH--i0VngtmzOiCU\u003d"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Q-zAhVKzlSY/hqdefault.jpg"]]]],[null,"Have you ever had fish on your brain, but you couldn\u0026#39;t go to your favorite fishing spots? Catching fish wasn’t fun enough in some casual fishing games? Play Fishing Clash – a free realistic fishing simulation game chosen by millions of anglers! \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eFishing Clash mixes thrilling features of multiplayer fishing games: the realism of simulator games, the competitiveness of sports games \u0026amp; the social aspect of fishing and hunting apps. It\u0026#39;s like a fishing forecast app in the virtual world where every angler can compete with others. Offering various fishing spots worldwide, it\u0026#39;s a realistic multiplayer simulation game amongst free fishing games.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eHow to catch a fish in this fishing simulator?\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e• Launch the game.\u003cbr\u003e• Tap the cast button in the bottom-right corner of the game.\u003cbr\u003e• Keep tapping the strike button continuously to ensure the line tension indicator is in the top bar center.\u003cbr\u003e• Enjoy the look of the fish on your hook!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eWhat\u0026#39;s next in Fishing Clash?\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e• Start catching more fish or win duels in pvp game mode.\u003cbr\u003e• Take part in multiplayer challenges and championships.\u003cbr\u003e• Win Lure Cards and upgrade them to level up and unlock new fishing spots!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eA game with dozens of fisheries worldwide\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003eFrom Florida Coast \u0026amp; Kenai River to Lake Biwa, Galapagos \u0026amp; Loch Ness – in this multiplayer simulation game, you can find a fishery almost everywhere globally and lots of different fish like bass, carp, trout, shark, and even some monster fish from the Deep Sea.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eFish smart\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003eCollect lure cards like in CCG \u0026amp; upgrade them to catch bigger fish! The greatest ones let you win competitive multiplayer games, master angler \u0026amp; world cup tournaments – that\u0026#39;s something you won\u0026#39;t find neither in free fishing apps nor in the other multiplayer fishing games!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eReal-time duels simulator\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003eFeel the thrill of multiplayer games and play a fishing duel against other anglers. You need skills to catch a fish and brains and strategy to win duels. Master skills \u0026amp; win every multiplayer fishing battle in the pvp game mode.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eTake part in live events\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003eVisit different fishing spots \u0026amp; hunt for amazing rewards like new rods, Lure Cards, and skill tokens. Pass the fishing trial, challenge angry sharks, become a catfish hunter or a traveler catching the biggest fish on a few different fishing spots!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eJoin or create a clan\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003eAlthough Fishing Clash is a simulator at its heart, it enables ways to socialize like in free fishing apps. Meet fellow anglers, exchange lure cards for different fishing spots \u0026amp; work together for great rewards in multiplayer Clan Wars.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eCatching fish with your skills\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003eAll fishing spots have their skill tree. Use skill tokens to unlock new skills and get bonuses to particular fish species, fish rarity, and more! Advance to fishing master league while competing in different pvp game modes.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eBreathtaking fishing spots\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003eWhether you prefer flick fishing, ice fishing, or trolling, you\u0026#39;ll admire the look of all fishing points. Every fishery in Fishing Clash features beautiful 3D vistas and hand-crafted fish you\u0026#39;ll love to see on your fishing hook. It\u0026#39;s a realistic simulator, after all.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eRegular, nice and new content!\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003eNew fish, new fishery, new rods – in this realistic simulator, you can find new content every week as there\u0026#39;s no shortage of fish to catch!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eA game you can’t miss in 2025\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003eWhether you\u0026#39;re a seasoned fish angler or casual multiplayer games fan, Fishing Clash is a great choice. With tens of fishing spots worldwide and hundreds of fish species, it offers a thrilling experience of the free fishing games genre. Don\u0026#39;t look for any other free simulator. DOWNLOAD NOW and catch the trophy fish, angler! Game on!"],"Ten Square Games","100,000,000+",null,"",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/pwPm37j2BXYsfcmYA_ieEcYScRgSmYPDY4tiYToXjYDGhzo90Gf-cpanGdn8BwnJ8TfL-rCgdvPN5XnMxUwurQ"],null,[17,92,106,255]],null,["Rated for 16+",[null,2,[366,512],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/djaflVB_tFGRjZlfs-xrcdSPeI_CUG3TTewlYuSFjq1tsNXxb4aZqAq0uMFzUtiZI_R65RtDyr4Zt2vt"]],null,[null,"Users Interact, In-Game Purchases (Includes Random Items)"],[null,"\u003ca href\u003d\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\u003dappgame_ratings\"\u003eLearn more\u003c/a\u003e"],1,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/UAlGNLgnQRVs-XrK_mUGJw1h_nlO1Ykv0jZK-YoRrRYIGIWmRdE_CCPB7U34jAiz4xLWUAqQ5Me7Daq7N_8"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\u003dappgame_r