img.com/vi/E9zekXpn9C4/hqdefault.jpg"]]]],[null,"A Masterpiece That Breaks Mobile Limits\u003cbr\u003ePixel Adventure RPG Guardian Tales\u003cbr\u003eTwist-filled stories, high-quality pixel art, and endless content await!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eA Legendary Journey Begins!\u003cbr\u003eExplore a vast world, meet Champions, and uncover the kingdom’s fate.\u003cbr\u003eAdventure like never before—only in Guardian Tales!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e◆ An RPG Packed with Story and Surprises!\u003cbr\u003eA world filled with unexpected twists and charming characters.\u003cbr\u003eHope and despair collide—what truth will you uncover?\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e◆ Over 150 Unique Pixel Heroes!\u003cbr\u003eUnique combat styles, vibrant voice acting, and adorable costumes!\u003cbr\u003eSummon, collect, and grow your team to victory!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e◆ Puzzle and Action Combined!\u003cbr\u003eLift boulders, throw bombs, and uncover hidden treasures!\u003cbr\u003eDodge, attack, and jump your way through thrilling manual-action gameplay!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e◆ Tons of Content to Explore!\u003cbr\u003eExperience endless challenges, from idle roguelite adventures to real-time PvP battles!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e◆ Multiplayer Battles—Team Up \u0026amp; Conquer!\u003cbr\u003eFight for your guild’s glory and claim thrilling victories through teamwork!\u003cbr\u003eGuild content, Co-op Raids, Team Deathmatch, and more await!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e◆ Relax and Customize Your Own Space!\u003cbr\u003eCreate your floating castle, \u0026quot;Heavenhold,\u0026quot; design your \u0026quot;My Room,\u0026quot; and personalize your profile card! \u003cbr\u003eEnjoy farming, ranching, fishing, and peaceful moments with your beloved heroes!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e■ Official Community ■\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e[GLOBAL]\u003cbr\u003eJoin our official Guardian Tales pages!\u003cbr\u003eFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/guardiantales  \u003cbr\u003eTwitter: https://twitter.com/GuardianTalesEN   \u003cbr\u003eDiscord: https://discord.gg/x96nDgK  \u003cbr\u003eInstagram: https://www.instagram.com/guardiantales_official\u003cbr\u003eYouTube: https://www.youtube.com/@GuardianTalesEN \u003cbr\u003eTwitch: https://www.twitch.tv/playkakaogames \u003cbr\u003eWebsite: https://www.guardiantales.com\u003cbr\u003e[ASIA]\u003cbr\u003ehttps://www.facebook.com/GuardianTalesAsia  \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e■ Help and Support ■\u003cbr\u003eAre you having problems?\u003cbr\u003eGLOBAL: Visit  https://gdtsglobal.zendesk.com/hc/en-us or contact us in game by going to Settings \u0026gt; Account Settings \u0026gt; Inquiry.\u003cbr\u003eASIA: Visit  https://gdtsasia.zendesk.com/hc/en-us or contact us in game by going to Settings \u0026gt; Account Settings \u0026gt; Inquiry.\u003cbr\u003ePrivacy Policy: https://web-data-cdn.kakaogames.com/real/www/html/terms/index.html?service\u003dS0001\u0026amp;type\u003dT003  \u003cbr\u003eTerms of Service: https://web-data-cdn.kakaogames.com/real/www/html/terms/index.html?service\u003dS0001\u0026amp;type\u003dT001  \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e■Your device will need at least 3GB of available storage space to install the game.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e---------------------------------------\u003cbr\u003e■ Minimum Specs ■\u003cbr\u003e- Android 5.0 or above\u003cbr\u003e- CPU: 2.0GHz or above\u003cbr\u003e- Ram: 2GB\u003cbr\u003e- Available Storage: 3GB\u003cbr\u003e---------------------------------------"],"Kong Studios, Inc.","10,000,000+",null,"",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/yb67chugXtNOAH7kWqo9V4aqQfgeThTgk0Yw2MrWFxS720wAVj4ZEw_mbH7s1w8AjRwSz7vkM06Oq5pY9IY74JY"],null,[148,197,238,255]],null,["Rated for 16+",[null,2,[366,512],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/djaflVB_tFGRjZlfs-xrcdSPeI_CUG3TTewlYuSFjq1tsNXxb4aZqAq0uMFzUtiZI_R65RtDyr4Zt2vt"]],[null,"Moderate Violence, Mild Swearing"],[null,"Users Interact, In-Game Purchases (Includes R