br\u003eDreamy Wonderland — New Themed Season Now Available!\u003cbr\u003eThe new themed season, Dreamy Wonderland, is now live! Dark Zone Hunt comes with brand-new rewards, Island Dreamscape introduces an all-new gameplay experience, and Homestead Invasion awaits your challenge. Explore the new seasonal content and embark on an exciting new adventure in the wilderness!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e｜New Gameplay｜\u003cbr\u003eIsland Dreamscape — Build Your Own Island Playground!\u003cbr\u003eThe brand-new Island Dreamscape is now available! Every island can be transformed into a playable map of your own. Freely customize your island and turn it into a battlefield or racetrack, then publish it for players across the server to challenge. You can also match into islands designed by other players and experience thrilling battles or exciting races. With Battle Royale and Casual Racing modes available, create your own island and turn it into a playground for players everywhere!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e｜New Dungeon｜\u003cbr\u003eBlazar Restricted Area · Zeus Lab — The Challenge Begins!\u003cbr\u003eA hidden space lies deep within the core area of Skyforge City, concealing Lockheed\u0026#39;s ultimate weapon project. The brand-new dungeon, Blazar Restricted Area · Zeus Lab, is now open! The dangerous entity Eye of Zeus has emerged. Venture into the unknown, uncover the secrets hidden within the laboratory, and face the challenge!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e｜New Progression System｜\u003cbr\u003eVirtual Empowerment · Mechanoid Progression Upgraded!\u003cbr\u003eThe new “Virtual Empowerment” progression system is now available, with an exclusive talent tree added to every Mechanoid. Develop Mechanoids and unlock talents to gain exclusive attributes and passive bonuses. Once activated, these bonuses permanently apply to your character, allowing you to continuously increase your combat power without deploying or setting the Mechanoid to “Follow.”\u003cbr\u003ePlease note that skills of Red-quality Mechanoids can only be activated when the Mechanoid is set to “Follow.” Develop your Mechanoids, unlock more talents, and take your combat power to the next level!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e｜Gameplay Updates｜\u003cbr\u003eS29-S30 New Seasons Now Available!\u003cbr\u003eThe new S29-S30 seasons are now live, bringing fresh seasonal challenges and exciting content for Ravens to explore. Embark on a brand-new journey through the wilderness!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e｜System Updates｜\u003cbr\u003eMultiple System Improvements and Optimizations!\u003cbr\u003eSchedule Rewards have been updated for characters Lv. 230 and above, while the server level cap has also been adjusted. The Rating System now includes Exoskeleton and Armory ratings, providing a more comprehensive experience for character progression and combat power evaluation."],"Garena Mobile Private","5,000,000+",null,"",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/2g6qMJpXTTOsbm9p1k4C7ZxyLdg5wV7tv91RAq970xP15CrBZj6TJIjfx0Pe_KfbfbIqt-786twCLER9cRCT8w"],null,[171,198,215,255]],null,["Rated for 12+",[null,2,[366,512],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/yQChfa9XKlaXMIYTk8w8QwChjT8_SH-_2d2SS-kesw0TLQK1nxtw54bDcoZ09freZJgKrtg4f__is-31Vg"]],[null,"Moderate Violence"],[null,"Users Interact"],[null,"\u003ca href\u003d\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\u003dappgame_ratings\"\u003eLearn more\u003c/a\u003e"],1,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/YrkR-GP7OKghBTATCoO_jJrchSVrh-NSUBb5DnbRZC1DbLK_cgV9FC2e_iI4GzLsKXuZjuFZajnGCiA8qA"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\u003dappgame_ratings"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,"IDR",""]],null,[null,"Buy"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\u003dcom.garena.game.lmjx\u0026rdid\u003dcom.garena.game.lmjx\u0026feature\u003dmd\u0026offerId"]],null,["CAE\u003d"],null,null,null,null,null,