.com/store/apps/details?id\u003dcom.im30.ROE.gp\u0026rdid\u003dcom.im30.ROE.gp\u0026feature\u003dmd\u0026offerId"]],null,["CAE\u003d"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,"/store/apps/details?id\u003dcom.im30.ROE.gp"]],["\u003d"],[[[null,null,"CwrrpzNIZaI",[null,null,"https://www.youtube.com/embed/CwrrpzNIZaI?vq\u003dlarge\u0026rel\u003d0\u0026autohide\u003d1\u0026showinfo\u003d0"],"yt:movie:CwrrpzNIZaI",null,null,null,null,"AXH1ezkUrsmh0ltOg91WwC9Rv7avAw8Asg88dB3t5Fnmd9rIZmt-Nzd94BbBrpBsqADnwnQ6J0ij8-Lz4_jta5UWdpHUkVeeoiYPUhzQA9uWitDGZ1VLA2MBUogckxpba9houG3aee1jdkzexhZ0nYptZWa20-oSseYUc_oNYOCfp9-TMTJsdDVBSCHbfcQNBuv9_h1_UxG4p9dRwAM8nyxQKlts-AdFgdC379PlYRHLBjamDTh-HMcErTmrteirzOdIIjNeLizbwjeCvaRWV65NAtZ840wG61JW5xZIN2VaRWw\u003d"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/CwrrpzNIZaI/hqdefault.jpg"]]]],[null,"\u003cb\u003eOne World, One Server\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eReal Time Nation vs. Nation medieval strategy war game. Join now! Train your troops and go to war!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ci\u003eRise of Castles\u003c/i\u003e is a Massive Multi-Player, Real-Time strategy war game. The player will take on the role of a leader in a small town devastated by the invasion of the Eastern Dynasty and the mysterious appearance of the legendary Death Harbingers who now has corrupted and have full control of the ancient powers of the dragons. Build your castle once again from the ruins, train your troops, tame dragons, recruit legendary heroes and join your allies in the non-ending war. To befriend or to plunder, the choice is yours!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eUnique Features\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003e-World Wide War\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003eReal-time combat against players across the world, lead your country to greatness\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003e-Strategic Gameplay\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003eOne set of units just simply cannot dominate, Footmen, Cavalries and Archers, You have to know your enemy and yourself to walk the battlefield of this world.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003e-Powerful Dragons\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003ePowerful dragons each with different unique shouts are at your disposal, crush your enemies with their help!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003e-Hero System\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003eWhether you like to engage your enemies at a distance, take them on at close quarters, or you enjoy developing your base at home, there are TONS of heroes that can help you with just that!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003e-Alliance Warfare\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003eWhether it’s going against different servers, or fighting for the title of the president at home, your alliance will always be backing you up, as long as you find the right people of course.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003e-Realistic Graphics\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThe Map, The World, Your City, The Units, The Heroes, Everything just seems, REAL\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003e-Build Your Castle\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003eAbsolute Freedom in City Building, upgrade your facilities, research your technologies, train your troops and recruit powerful heroes to strengthen your castle!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eNOTE: Rise of Castles is free to download and free to play, but does offer in-app purchases of items and other gifts. In-app purchases can be disabled through your device’s settings."],"Long Tech Network Limited","10,000,000+",null,"",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/cdHxdx-5ejg4wvwBbmgsaLe2-9hIMjcKdAetqEr46j-hBiO0Rl_wd3a-WsTgzHPEoN7RcATzYpEDeNhPTozh"],null,[108,170,197,255]],null,["Rated for 16+",[null,2,[366,512],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/djaflVB_tFGRjZlfs-xrcdSPeI_CUG3TTewlYuSFjq1tsNXxb4aZqAq0uMFzUtiZI_R65RtDyr4Zt2vt"]],[null,"Moderate Violence"],[null,"Users Interact, In-Game Purchases (Includes Random Items)"],[null,"\u003ca href\u003d\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\u003dappgame_ratings\"\u003eLearn more\u003c/a\u003e"],1,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/UAlGNLgnQRVs-XrK_mUGJw1h_nlO1Ykv0jZK-YoRrRYIGIWmRdE_CCPB7U34jAiz4xLWUAqQ5Me7Daq7N_8"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\u003dappgame_ratings"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,"IDR",""]],null,[null,"Buy"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\u003dcom.im30.ROE.gp\u0026rdid\u003dcom.im30.ROE.gp\u0026feature\u003dmd\u0026offerId"]],null,["CAE\u003d"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],["Install"],null,["CgYKBENBRT0\u003d"]]]],[2],null,[1,1,0],["Rp 18.000 - Rp 3.549.818 per item",[0]],{"101":[null,[[null,2,[1242,2208],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/FYm6jYVj6k1Ar66fi9Bo13oCZTHA_rhLMuYLmjBsWDy4ENxERrpcDDAbcqY489PNlMjMVKRAm9N9vQuGAqrrESg"]],[null,2,[1242,2208],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Gq8xnmqTkZ1ZTaGCAF8Kqh-0uZiDgwjkTeJols6VSy7T0jejE9gTQSFh3OKBLgLNYadzizjWeEbbMYrgsZSN2xM"]],[null,2,[1242,2208],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/bUgeURXobblOijJGhTZGUJZU31OsX7E7Cd3j9jKNV4Vy_ubGmsX3P9t4AxByq5sL9hsgO6bf6aloY2j4r83nVA"]],[null,2,[1242,2208],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/UIwEG5iskHBEvg14bSc_4POHrbhnHghk_ROUTA89oCIYu-UEv4GW5SludRrgOCEb-uY0ElQbzuaYvR7mljJn"]],[null,2,[1242,2208],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/wL_aCTDY1zz5-GDm1EaXcYd4dSDqBg0X3PT_-QCUcFLVhtHaOrr8WcDXHwWHzEd_w-z_UfQLC8UxBYXPj32RNQ"]],[null,2,[1242,2208],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/KDE7WpQaUG1Z-zzKJ9knE3ik3O-5xrWqkBQrAhMLnIKQ0uZ0yHUR3He30xn3TsurveXzUHleWhERPTo75gZM"]],[null,2,[1242,2208],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/PDqe-2MeTfxw2FusefiH0vKNTVR1slZBCKnlj0B8uqUiZISnjgnmsK7aa88DnHO69CkxiivQNfiLHurqcRw"]],[null,2,[2048,2732],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/6-PM2s_alA2iDlTlOUKJZ1ZXU3zZkThwFHJ7YE