s/details?id\u003dcom.rxsj.an.en4399"]],[""],null,[null,"The duel between Wukong and Tiger Man has officially begun! \u003cbr\u003eNew class \u0026quot;Dark Wukong\u0026quot; makes a grand debut!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cfont color\u003d\"red\"\u003e★ Exclusive gift code 【2024WUKONG】, redeem your exclusive rewards ★\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cfont color\u003d\"red\"\u003e★ Use gift code【Heroes777】 to triumph over your enemies ★\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThis is a battle about honor, and even more so a battle about faith! \u003cbr\u003eWho do you hope will be the king of the mountain? \u003cbr\u003eWho do you expect to win? \u003cbr\u003eLet\u0026#39;s wait and see!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThis is a myterious and colorful oriental martial world. \u003cbr\u003eThere are dense and prosperous ancient forests,\u003cbr\u003eThere are peaceful and primitive banyan,\u003cbr\u003eThere are various pets wandering freely,\u003cbr\u003eThere are heroes gathering from different regions,\u003cbr\u003eLong time no see my friends, let\u0026#39;s begin our new adventure in Yong Heroes 2 together!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e[Rich Welfare]\u003cbr\u003eYou can get 1000 free draws to gain various awards as your newbie property, which will help you fit this journey better! \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e[Storm Returns]\u003cbr\u003eBetween devil and Buddha Wukong was born with tremendous power to destroy the Heaven and the earth. He was bewitched by the devil, but did not go astray. Instead, his divine power was awakened, and his body became tough and unbreakable. He is known as the Battle God. As the Battle God, Wukong is not happy about the corruption of the martial arts world, and is determined to tear down the masks of those pretenders.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e[5 Brand New Classes]\u003cbr\u003eShao Lin, Tang Men, Tian Shan, Ranger, Rageblade... you can select from 5 upgraded new classes now. The combat of martial world is approaching. Will you be that hero that stepping to the top? Just experience this dream made of sword and blade. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e[Buddies Gather to Slay Boss]\u003cbr\u003eYou will meet friends from different regions here! Take your weapons, join the guilds, and gather your buddies to slay boss together. This will tell the benefits of teamwork.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e[Diverse Mounts and Pets]\u003cbr\u003eYou can find loyal mounts and pets everwhere on this vast land, just collect and tame them.\u003cbr\u003eImagine wander freely with a big, cute panda? Your dream will come true now!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eDark Wukong is waiting for you in Yong Heroes 2!"],"TTHmobi","5,000,000+",null,"",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/FrVlXQg46dKwlwI9c4lf4yPy18uTfts1E3vgXEanMHtjXOU_uGHdIWjbi3djWNgs-_o0v9lZXmqZZXKUHdx2xQ"],null,[38,8,6,255]],null,["Rated for 12+",[null,2,[366,512],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/yQChfa9XKlaXMIYTk8w8QwChjT8_SH-_2d2SS-kesw0TLQK1nxtw54bDcoZ09freZJgKrtg4f__is-31Vg"]],[null,"Moderate Violence"],[null,"Users Interact, In-Game Purchases"],[null,"\u003ca href\u003d\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\u003dappgame_ratings\"\u003eLearn more\u003c/a\u003e"],1,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/YrkR-GP7OKghBTATCoO_jJrchSVrh-NSUBb5DnbRZC1DbLK_cgV9FC2e_iI4GzLsKXuZjuFZajnGCiA8qA"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\u003dappgame_ratings"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,"IDR",""]],null,[null,"Buy"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\u003dcom.rxsj.an.en4399\u0026rdid\u003dcom.rxsj.an.en4399\u0026feature\u003dmd\u0026offerId"]],null,["CAE\u003d"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],["Install"],null,["CgYKBENBRT0\u003d"]]]],[2],null,[1,1,0],["Rp 16.500 - Rp 1.649.000 per item",[0]],{"101":[null,[[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,"ht