------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cfont color\u003d\"#FF6103\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSeek for truth in the world of Ode to Heroes, and waken potential heroes!\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003cbr\u003eLead your heroes to adventure throughout the history and repair the disordered timeline!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cfont color\u003d\"#FF6103\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e★Easy and Idled Gameplay★\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003cbr\u003eIt’s a time and energy-saving mobile game!\u003cbr\u003eYou can enjoy it anytime and anywhere possible!\u003cbr\u003eClaim abundant rewards even in offline mode!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cfont color\u003d\"#FF6103\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e★Experience Legendary Adventures in Epic★\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003cbr\u003eSeek for potential heroes in the chaotic timeline!\u003cbr\u003eHundreds of legendary personages with distinctive characteristics and experience. Earn their loyalty to fight for you!\u003cbr\u003eAncient equipment, legendary artifacts, all kinds of surprises are awaiting you to explore!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cfont color\u003d\"#FF6103\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e★Endless Joy From Strategy★\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003cbr\u003eOver 200 heroes from different factions, mastering hundreds of unique skills!\u003cbr\u003eSet flexible formation and strategy with your high damage, healing, and controlling heroes!\u003cbr\u003eCollect and forge artifacts, jade and equipment, Match them strategically!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cfont color\u003d\"#FF6103\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e★Rich Game Content★\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003cbr\u003eIDLE strategy auto-battle, combat, dungeons, hero quests, collection, training!\u003cbr\u003eArena, Guild, Treasure Hunt, Friends, Government!\u003cbr\u003eInfinite excitement is waiting for you to explore!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cfont color\u003d\"#FF6103\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e★Exciting Gameplay Featuring Social Networking★\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003cbr\u003eCreate the strongest legendary guild with other players!\u003cbr\u003eChallenge powerful guild Boss!\u003cbr\u003eTeam up with like-minded friends, challenge worldwide players on the rankings for the highest glory and formidable trophies!\u003cbr\u003eCompete for the Ranking and Highest Glory to win mighty trophies!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eKind reminder：\u003cbr\u003eIt needs WRITE_EXTERNAL_STORAGE and READ_EXTERNAL_STORAGE permissions due to video Ads.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eContact us:\u003cbr\u003eEmail: qqccs@droidhang.com\u003cbr\u003eFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/OdeToHeroes\u003cbr\u003eTwitter: https://twitter.com/odetoheroes\u003cbr\u003eInstagram: https://www.instagram.com/odetoheroes_official"],"NGT-Games","1,000,000+",null,"",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/wXKqqtfftqgygScIIYsgNqtkAjD8lcAO5YCz38vbhrKXfgT2fnXvN-SQC7W43KvfuvkdJ5sU0iLTMJr7cE_5-w"],null,[146,61,40,255]],null,["Rated for 7+",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/1SrNtAwg9PFOhgMJPXehacRTeQNhHhG12Pj1zACHNVmfRfEZA3_oOEmLvRNsmYGeGHpas7sCwyR3y8OT"]],[null,"Mild Violence"],[null,"Users Interact, In-Game Purchases (Includes Random Items)"],[null,"\u003ca href\u003d\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\u003dappgame_ratings\"\u003eLearn more\u003c/a\u003e"],1,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/JTT-ImEkrbWzIL7w0fP8fQhVmpexdfh7u0P59PJtyJywmQBVolJjunMal6B5dUM6uiFiKnmtHtBbVvcWBMU"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\u003dappgame_ratings"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,"IDR",""]],null,[null,"Buy"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\u003dcom.droidhang.ad2.official.android\u0026rdid\u003dcom.droidhang.ad2.official.android\u0026feature\u003dmd\u