olorful blocks, and satisfying combos to create the perfect puzzle experience for players of all ages.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eWhether you\u0026#39;re looking for fun games to relax, challenging brain puzzles, or engaging brain games to train your mind, Block Blast delivers endless entertainment both online and offline.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e🌟 Why You\u0026#39;ll Love Block Blast\u003cbr\u003e🔸 Fun Brain Games for Everyone\u003cbr\u003eEnjoy simple yet addictive gameplay that turns every level into a fun brain challenge.\u003cbr\u003e🔹 Relaxing Puzzle Experience\u003cbr\u003eSolve colorful block puzzles, clear rows and columns, and enjoy relaxing brain training with satisfying visual effects.\u003cbr\u003e🔸 Train Your Brain with Puzzles\u003cbr\u003eImprove your logic, focus, and problem-solving skills with engaging brain puzzle gameplay designed to stimulate your mind.\u003cbr\u003e🔹 Play Anytime – No WiFi Needed\u003cbr\u003eEnjoy fun puzzle games anywhere. Block Blast is a perfect offline brain game for relaxing on the go.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e💥 Features of Block Blast\u003cbr\u003e● Addictive Brain Puzzle Gameplay\u003cbr\u003ePlace blocks strategically on the board and clear lines to solve challenging puzzles.\u003cbr\u003e● Fun Games with Endless Challenges\u003cbr\u003eEach round is a new brain game where smart moves lead to higher scores.\u003cbr\u003e● Daily Brain Training Challenges\u003cbr\u003eSharpen your mind with new puzzles every day and complete exciting brain challenges.\u003cbr\u003e● Smooth \u0026amp; Relaxing Gameplay\u003cbr\u003eDesigned as a relaxing puzzle experience with vibrant visuals and satisfying effects.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e🎮 How to Play\u003cbr\u003e● Drag blocks onto the board to create full rows or columns.\u003cbr\u003e● Clear blocks to score points and trigger exciting combos.\u003cbr\u003e● Plan ahead and solve each puzzle like a true brain game master.\u003cbr\u003e● Keep the board clear and challenge your logic skills.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e✨ Tips for Brain Puzzle Masters\u003cbr\u003e● Think ahead and keep space open for larger blocks.\u003cbr\u003e● Combine moves to trigger powerful combos.\u003cbr\u003e● Improve your strategy and master the ultimate brain puzzle challenge.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e🔥 Start the Fun Brain Game Now!\u003cbr\u003eReady for relaxing fun games and addictive brain puzzles?\u003cbr\u003eDownload Block Blast today and enjoy one of the most entertaining brain games with endless puzzle fun."],"HungryStudio","1,000,000,000+",null,"",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/KU-KnbhO3sOZ9pyjIZnKWtTGluO8jGPOkDlikyH_4ZyXmJsN7tiK57rn7WbNFpZsyqaOcGByNeoNtdc2qwIauFA"],null,[33,28,133,255]],null,["Rated for 3+",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ"]],null,[null,"In-Game Purchases"],[null,"\u003ca href\u003d\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\u003dappgame_ratings\"\u003eLearn more\u003c/a\u003e"],1,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_re6mcALPaqotePA0WkgYeOQ6TighHRUS62FRmREPEhyZPdGM3QmRjcSpiMt6Pz1O-WZyvEIy4mtGHj9zw"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\u003dappgame_ratings"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,"IDR",""]],null,[null,"Buy"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\u003dcom.block.juggle\u0026rdid\u003dcom.block.juggle\u0026feature\u003dmd\u0026offerId"]],null,["CAE\u003d"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],["Install"],null,["CgYKBENBRT0\u003d"]]]],[2],null,[1,1,0],["Rp 78.000 - Rp 790.000 per item",[0]],{"101":[null,[[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/e0kUZ5woI-XHVSRZDJoEvevTxxEAMAeQSf5ThCfCSITlWw_7kDSCjqgjuqjU99R1Q4JEWZrFAGVEbsZUSBxK8Q"]],[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/6RqJxq94c