8E7x3T8c5GsKvg6CEZkyBYKE-HPRsAUKSzsSCNzOX08EKWkujxPX9wqUnSGQGBoyFaer99XJj_BaOLNmOfuIERb8QJZjRs1QeoL4-85qDEwKnJn4J8NfeAhrUdvSVIvs4Ihe04dKZ1xgLKu5BuWPbM2nsABmRWVuWKjVLPM4jDfEBkFZmKB2TOLC2VkSEPpUM6tZS0bvSiCjzMIrIfzHhNdAEI_8tJHZYQIoHpodRvybTp8-oY\u003d"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/WkOJahnLQ3A/hqdefault.jpg"]]]],[null,"This game includes optional in-game purchases of virtual currency that can be used to acquire virtual in-game items, including a random selection of virtual in-game items. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003ePlay EA SPORTS FC™ Soccer Mobile 27, the ultimate online soccer game on mobile. EA SPORTS FC™ Mobile 27 Update has arrived. Celebrate the 2026/2027 season of soccer / football, in an update inspired by the World\u0026#39;s Game. \u003cbr\u003e \u003cbr\u003ePlay a Quick Match as any team from the Premier League, MLS or LALIGA EA SPORTS including Liverpool \u0026amp; Real Madrid. Choose a national team including Portugal, Spain, USA, Brazil, England etc \u0026amp; compete to become champions. Build your dream Football Ultimate Team™ with soccer stars Kylian Mbappé, Jude Bellingham, Pedri or legendary ICONs like David Beckham, Ronaldinho, Zinedine Zidane \u0026amp; Zlatan Ibrahimović. FC Mobile has licenses for the world’s biggest soccer competitions, national teams, clubs \u0026amp; leagues. \u003cbr\u003e  \u003cbr\u003eKEY 2027 FEATURES\u003cbr\u003eScore Goals with the world’s best players \u003cbr\u003eLevel up an Ultimate Team of soccer super stars\u003cbr\u003ePlay a Quick Match with Friends, playing as the club or national team of your choice\u003cbr\u003eCompete in The World\u0026#39;s Game national soccer tournament mode\u003cbr\u003eJoin a League \u0026amp; team up to compete in tournaments and collect more rewards\u003cbr\u003eRank Up in PvP football game modes including 1v1 H2H, VS Attack \u0026amp; Football Manager Mode\u003cbr\u003eEarn Rewards faster with Daily Training, Quests and Achievements\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eTHE WORLD’S GAME TOURNAMENT\u003cbr\u003eChoose your national team and compete to become champions\u003cbr\u003eSelect from over 40 national teams including Portugal, Spain, USA, Brazil, England \u0026amp; more\u003cbr\u003eScore big goals with heroes from each nation\u003cbr\u003e \u003cbr\u003eCOMPETE IN HEAD TO HEAD PVP\u003cbr\u003ePlay PVP matches to rank up in Division Rivals \u003cbr\u003eEarn rewards as you climb weekly Leaderboards\u003cbr\u003eImproved ranking system \u0026amp; enhanced matchmaking\u003cbr\u003e \u003cbr\u003eJOIN LEAGUES, EARN REWARDS\u003cbr\u003eBigger Leagues! Join leagues with up to 100 members\u003cbr\u003eFind friends faster with Leagues tagged by language, clubs, region \u0026amp; more\u003cbr\u003eTeam up with your league to play tournaments \u0026amp; earn seasonal rewards\u003cbr\u003e \u003cbr\u003eAUTHENTIC GAMEPLAY IMPROVEMENTS\u003cbr\u003eGame Plans: Play to win by swapping tactics mid-match \u003cbr\u003eEnhanced Passing System: Move the ball with improved precision \u0026amp; control assistance\u003cbr\u003ePlayer Authenticity: More impactful attributes \u0026amp; skill moves based on their real world performance\u003cbr\u003e \u003cbr\u003eQUICK MATCH WITH FRIENDS\u003cbr\u003eJump into a soccer game instantly with Quick Match\u003cbr\u003eChoose your Club, National Team or your Ultimate Team\u003cbr\u003eInvite friends for a fast soccer match \u0026amp; see who can score most\u003cbr\u003eCompete as Real Madrid, Liverpool, Chelsea, Manchester City \u0026amp;  more\u003cbr\u003e \u003cbr\u003eSOCCER / FOOTBALL LEAGUES, LEGENDS \u0026amp; COMPETITIONS\u003cbr\u003ePremier League, LALIGA EA SPORTS, MLS, UEFA Champions League UCL, Bundesliga, Ligue 1 McDonald’s, Serie A Enilive \u0026amp; many more are playable throughout the season\u003cbr\u003eRelive ICONic moments with soccer’s greatest players: David Beckham, Zlatan Ibrahimović, Ronaldinho, Zinedine Zidane \u0026amp; more\u003cbr\u003e \u003cbr\u003ePlay the World\u0026#39;s Game, Anywhere.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThis app: Requires acceptance of EA’s User Agreement and Privacy \u0026amp; Cookie Policy. Requires an Internet connection (network fees may apply). Contains direct links to the Internet and social networking sites intended for an audience over 13. Allows players (above the minimum age of digital consent in their country) to communicate via League chat; to disable for users under the age of majority with League chat access, use your device\u0026#39;s parental controls.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThis game includes optional in-game purchases of virtual currency that can be used to acquire virtual in-game items, including a random selection of virtual in-game items. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eUser Agreement: terms.ea.com \u003cbr\u003ePrivacy and Cookie Policy: privacy.ea.com \u003cbr\u003eVisit help.ea.com for assistance or inquiries. \u003cbr\u003eEA may retire online features after 30 days’ notice posted on ea.com/service-updates.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eNotice at Collection\u003cbr\u003ehttps://www.ea.com/legal/privacy-and-cookie-policy#information-for-california-residents\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eYour Privacy Choices\u003cbr\u003ehttps://www.ea.com/legal/privacy-portal?modal-id\u003dtargetedAdvertisingProvidedByThirdParties"],"ELECTRONIC ARTS","500,000,000+",null,"",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/kaNnad8NxbELyRedCNiJos7iJYm4FzZ7uHVpWiw2tFh-ZzucGpNHV_xVJ_svb4NhCUK4geSONeUVBzYeo1dYvWc"],null,[228,228,228,255]],null,["Rated for 16+",[null,2,[366,512],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/djaflVB_tFGRjZlfs-xrcdSPeI_CUG3TTewlYuSFjq1tsNXxb4aZqAq0uMFzUtiZI_R65RtDyr4Zt2vt"]],null,[null,"Users Interact, In-Game Purchases (Includes Random Items)"],[null,"\u003ca href\u003d\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\u003dappgame_ratings\"\u003eLearn more\u003c/a\u003e"],1,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleuserc