iRg7PPkCeOcTz5p5TEyig9VCZ96"]],[null,2,[2732,2048],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/LvOE5F6ubXR6agKoCyKo5ptA6kcJHpEqsQAbS6JVz_zQzqFlYp1phf1wZzYFEJjZBfaxsE4OIRJpPpyslNEP"]],[null,2,[2732,2048],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/xJOF7h8d_d56Wyl0_5lIavXCgC0ILqNMhCDLgi_5-kIjJOmI21-2IvptpeC6wZPSXAVR9DOmDLsTNQVSE-DTmQ"]],[null,2,[2732,2048],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/TJ_m8a1b8zOqRGlRE3jUQrdtPymTOq9aZPm1U2ZSTgFTrNDBLrEb4AL9FlxvMMlc189IO9kXLFGcPsQ299DxQA"]],[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/nufboeimFVkEL9nFIiSK0InesL468T8VG9J0BOMMhUHv92G5vQk1mrgbdA7dxng4LlKX-F_FLYF7Pw_ghclcSxI"]],[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/h0dwn4d2hj-bRboSI6_1_Sft_3SSzCVoOd_Lyxf8scPMQQxHKvZxNf5a59tm4mdOeJ1ryQJrcdci0kdOSxYr"]],[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/tpjQLNbBSe9kcAe-1J8KmEEkORSbJDnwlPfCyi77rM9dNdiB6oeiCFOJbmaFy49RlNGoztwwCeXyaykJEuSw"]]],"Vita Mahjong",["4.8",4.8166795],"Board",null,null,[null,[[0,"IDR",""]],null,[null,"Buy"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\u003dcom.vitastudio.mahjong\u0026rdid\u003dcom.vitastudio.mahjong\u0026feature\u003dmd\u0026offerId"]],null,["CAE\u003d"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,"/store/apps/details?id\u003dcom.vitastudio.mahjong"]],[""],null,[null,"• LIMITED-TIME KUNG FU PANDA COLLAB IS HERE!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eStep into the Valley of Peace with Po as your matching companion. For a limited time, Vita Mahjong weaves the quiet joy of classic mahjong together with the legendary world of DreamWorks Kung Fu Panda. It\u0026#39;s a Zen tile-matching journey where every match brings a moment of stillness, and every win adds a small spark of joy.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eBreathe in. Match. Breathe out. Skadoosh!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eCollab Highlights \u003cbr\u003e• Po \u0026amp; Friends Tile Set: Beautifully redesigned mahjong tiles starring the Dragon Warrior and his crew, in Vita Mahjong\u0026#39;s calm, cozy style.\u003cbr\u003e• Scenes from the Valley of Peace: Play across serene DreamWorks Kung Fu Panda backdrops where every board is a quiet moment.\u003cbr\u003e• Exclusive Collab Avatars \u0026amp; Frames: Unlock event-only, limited-edition avatars and frames that highlight your unique journey and make your profile pop.\u003cbr\u003e• Special Crossover Boards: Fresh mahjong puzzles crafted just for this collab. Only for a limited time.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eVita Mahjong is an exclusive tile-matching puzzle game that blends innovation with classic gameplay. Large tiles, a clean interface, and full pad and phone support make every session a calm, easy pleasure — mentally engaging without pressure.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eAt Vita Studio, we have always been dedicated to crafting mobile games that bring back relaxation, fun, and joy. Our repertoire includes popular titles like Vita Color, Vita Jigsaw, Vita Word Search, Vita Block, Vita Sudoku, and more.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eHow to Play Vita Mahjong: \u003cbr\u003ePlaying free Vita Mahjong game is simple. Just aim to clear all the tiles on the board by matching tiles with identical images. Tap or slide two matching tiles, and they will vanish from the board. Your objective is to match tiles that are not concealed or blocked. Once all tiles are eliminated, it signifies successful completion of a mahjong game!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eExclusive Vita Mahjong Game Features: \u003cbr\u003e• Classic Mahjong: Staying true to the original gameplay, it presents traditional card tile sets and hundreds of boards. \u003cbr\u003e• Special Innovations: Besides the classic, our game introduces special tiles that add a fresh twist to the classic mahjong. \u003cbr\u003e• Large-Scale Design: Our mahjong games feature large, easily readable tiles and text, making every board a pleasure to play on any screen. \u003cbr\u003e• Active Mind Levels: A special mode designed to sharpen your mind and improve memory abilities in mahjong games. \u003cbr\u003e• Customizable Scoring: You can enjoy free classic mahjong games without a timer and any score pressure. \u003cbr\u003e• Super Combo: When you consecutively match mahjong tiles during the game, you will unlock special experiences. \u003cbr\u003e• Helpful Hints: Our game provides free useful props, such as hints, undo, and shuffle, to help players overcome challenging puzzles. \u003cbr\u003e• Daily Challenge: Take on daily practice to collect trophies and improve your classic mahjong solitaire game skills. \u003cbr\u003e• Offline Mode: Full offline support lets you enjoy Vita Mahjong anytime, anywhere, without needing internet. \u003cbr\u003e• Multi-device: Optimized for pad and phone, ensuring everyone can enjoy the classic mahjong game.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e Vita Mahjong is a versatile game made for those who love tile matching games. And the DreamWorks Kung Fu Panda collab is Available Now! Begin your legendary mahjong adventure!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eNote: This is a puzzle game in the style of Mahjong Solitaire. It does not contain the rules of traditional Mahjong or other types of solitaire or card games. The term \u0026quot;Mahjong\u0026quot; here refers solely to the visual style of the tiles. DreamWorks Kung Fu Panda content is offered as a limited-time collaboration.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eContact us: support@vitastudio.ai \u003cbr\u003eFor more information, you can: \u003cbr\u003eJoin our Facebook group: https://www.facebook.com/groups/vitastudio \u003cbr\u003eVisit our official website: www.vitamahjong.com"],"Vita Studio.","100,000,000+",null,"",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/hObGWq0xspcr6ubcAauMxxmQhqKkesGRDD1WKCpCVoRXiySZGnEm80AEh05NX7jIUgtlMnr61UYDFxt-dXL48YA"],null,[22,55,51,255]],null,["Rated for 3+",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ"]],null,[null,"In-Game Purchases"],[null,"\u003ca href\u003d\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\u003dappgame_ratings\"\u003eLearn more\u003c/a\u003e"],1,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_re6mcALPaqotePA0WkgYeOQ6TighHRUS62FRmREPEhyZPdGM3QmRjcSpiMt6Pz1O-WZyvEIy4mtGHj9zw"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\u003dappgame_ratings"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,"IDR",""]],null,[null,"Buy"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\u003dcom.vitastudio.mahjong\u0026rdid\u003dcom.vitastudio.mahjong\u0026feature\u003dmd\u0026offerId"]],null,["CAE\u003d"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],["Install"],null,["CgYKBENBRT0\u003d"]]]],[2],null,[1,1,0],["Rp 16.000 - Rp 790.000 per item",[0]],{"101":[null,[[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/nufboeimFVkEL9nFIiSK0InesL468T8VG9J0BOMMhUHv92G5vQk1mrgbdA7dxng4LlKX-F_FLYF7Pw_ghclcSxI"]],[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/h0dwn4d2hj-bRboSI6_1_Sft_3SSzCVoOd_Lyxf8scPMQQxHKvZxNf5a59tm4mdOeJ1ryQJrcdci0kdOSxYr"]],[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/tpjQLNbBSe9kcAe-1J8KmEEkORSbJDnwlPfCyi77rM9dNdiB6oeiCFOJbmaFy49RlNGoztwwCeXyaykJEuSw"]],[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/nufboeimFVkEL9nFIiSK0InesL468T8VG9J0BOMMhUHv92G5vQk1mrgbdA7dxng4LlKX-F_FLYF7Pw_ghclcSxI"]],[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/h0dwn4d2hj-bRboSI6_1_Sft_3SSzCVoOd_Lyxf8scPMQQxHKvZxNf5a59tm4mdOeJ1ryQJrcdci0kdOSxYr"]],[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/tpjQLNbBSe9kcAe-1J8KmEEkORSbJDnwlPfCyi77rM9dNdiB6oeiCFOJbmaFy49RlNGoztwwCeXyaykJEuSw"]]],[[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/5HIdNCq_Tb8UTxA9OC3xTiSHtl1URW