ive your BitLife?\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eWill you become a successful millionaire, a loving parent, and a respected citizen? Or will you make reckless choices, start drama, break hearts, commit crimes, and create total chaos before you die?\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eBitLife is a text-based life simulator where every choice shapes your story. Live an entire virtual life from birth to death in this addictive simulation game. Build relationships, chase careers, make risky decisions, and discover how your choices change your future.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eLooking for a life simulator where choices actually matter? In BitLife, every life is different. Become famous, fall in love, start a family, survive scandals, go to prison, build a fortune, or live a completely unpredictable life.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eYour choices create your story.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eLIVE YOUR OWN LIFE STORY:\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eCreate a unique character and shape their destiny.\u003cbr\u003eMake choices that affect your relationships, career, health, happiness, and future.\u003cbr\u003eExperience love, marriage, family life, friendships, drama, and betrayal.\u003cbr\u003eBecome a doctor, actor, athlete, criminal, influencer, CEO, or anything in between.\u003cbr\u003eBuild your own virtual life story with endless roleplay possibilities.\u003cbr\u003eEvery year brings new opportunities, challenges, and unexpected consequences.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eTHE ULTIMATE LIFE SIMULATOR:\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003ePlay through a full virtual life from childhood to old age.\u003cbr\u003eA realistic text-based life simulator where every decision matters.\u003cbr\u003eBuild your dream life… or completely ruin it.\u003cbr\u003eDiscover thousands of random events, choices, and outcomes.\u003cbr\u003eNo two stories ever play out the same.\u003cbr\u003eOne life, you might become a famous millionaire. The next, you could end up broke and in prison.\u003cbr\u003eEvery playthrough creates a different story based on your decisions.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eMAKE GOOD OR BAD CHOICES:\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eFollow the rules and become a model citizen.\u003cbr\u003eOr embrace chaos with crime, prison escapes, scams, robberies, and risky behavior.\u003cbr\u003eCheat on your partner, start fights, create scandals, or chase fame.\u003cbr\u003eDeal with realistic consequences based on the choices you make.\u003cbr\u003eYour decisions shape your reputation, relationships, and future.\u003cbr\u003eChoose a peaceful family life… or a chaotic unpredictable one.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eROLEPLAY ANY LIFE:\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eLive rich, poor, famous, dangerous, romantic, or completely wild lives.\u003cbr\u003eExplore careers, education, dating, luxury lifestyles, and unexpected adventures.\u003cbr\u003eCreate funny, dramatic, wholesome, or chaotic stories.\u003cbr\u003ePlay your way in a sandbox life simulation full of possibilities.\u003cbr\u003ePerfect for players who enjoy life simulation games, interactive storytelling, and choice-based gameplay.\u003cbr\u003eBuild unlimited unique character stories with every new life.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eWHY PLAY BITLIFE?\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eAddictive text-based gameplay.\u003cbr\u003eEndless replayability.\u003cbr\u003eInteractive story choices that truly matter.\u003cbr\u003eFree to play life simulator.\u003cbr\u003eA highly replayable virtual life simulator with player-driven storytelling.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eYour virtual life starts now.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eHow will YOU live your BitLife?\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eJOIN OUR COMMUNITY:\u003cbr\u003eTikTok: @bitlifeapp\u003cbr\u003eX: @BitLifeApp\u003cbr\u003eInstagram: @bitlifeapp"],"Candywriter, LLC","50,000,000+",null,"",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/qt1bE4rc70rx-PcKMnHVUlbqAITRK0nYlGWwGRhn_ip0MIR_cXejsooK8C4GzMOBYT2r_jWGFE9AfaiRmYB9QQ"],null,[247,57,5,255]],null,["Rated for 16+",[null,2,[366,512],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/djaflVB_tFGRjZlfs-xrcdSPeI_CUG3TTewlYuSFjq1tsNXxb4aZqAq0uMFzUtiZI_R65RtDyr4Zt2vt"]],[null,"Sex"],[null,"In-Game Purchases"],[null,"\u003ca href\u003d\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\u003dappgame_ratings\"\u003eLearn more\u003c/a\u003e"],1,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/UAlGNLgnQRVs-XrK_mUGJw1h_nlO1Ykv0jZK-YoRrRYIGIWmRdE_CCPB7U34jAiz4xLWUAqQ5Me7Daq7N_8"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\u003dappgame_ratings"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,"IDR",""]],null,[null,"Buy"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\u003dcom.candywriter.bitlife\u0026rdid\u003dcom.candywriter.bitlife\u0026feature\u003dmd\u0026offerId"]],null,["CAE\u003d"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],["Install"],null,["CgYKBENBRT0\u003d"]]]],[2],null,[1,1,0],["Rp 16.000 - Rp 399.000 per item",[0]]],[[null,null,null,null,[null,null,"/store/apps/details?id\u003dcom.candywriter.bitlife"]],["CCGqAnkadwgFShMI7YvXn6TXlwMVX7usAh0MMi4IsgRdClkKHQoXY29tLmNhbmR5d3JpdGVyLmJpdGxpZmUQARgDEhkKEzQ4MzIzMzkwODQwMTQwNzU5NDAQURgDGAMgAijgwqCGlDQwgPPDoZk0QAFIAVoCCAFgAYABAjAI"],[[null,[[0,"IDR",""]],null,[null,"Buy"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\u003dcom.candywriter.bitlife\u0026rdid\u003dcom.candywriter.bitlife\u0026feature\u003dmd\u0026offerId"]],null,["CAE\u003d"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],[null,"October brings a graveyard\u0026#39;s worth of new Halloween challenges to survive."],[null,"Vampires are Back! Spooky season is officially here and BitLife is celebrating with a full month of Halloween challenges. New frights, new goals, new chaos all October long. Jump in anytime and see if you\u0026#39;ve got what it takes to make it to Halloween night in one piece."],[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/eY