"Buy"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\u003dcom.sinyee.babybus.shopping\u0026rdid\u003dcom.sinyee.babybus.shopping\u0026feature\u003dmd\u0026offerId"]],null,["CAE\u003d"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,"/store/apps/details?id\u003dcom.sinyee.babybus.shopping"]],["\u003d\u003d"],[[[null,null,"BPiXg7jtq-o",[null,null,"https://www.youtube.com/embed/BPiXg7jtq-o?vq\u003dlarge\u0026rel\u003d0\u0026autohide\u003d1\u0026showinfo\u003d0"],"yt:movie:BPiXg7jtq-o",null,null,null,null,"AXH1eznAMWRuuHd-gpR-tcEMhCFtgE5yEcHE5ZJxO0YaFGXSLBWzGMo0_jF-fCIJMN0LGmHX9PMPv6QtYKKX5DeCC_GatQnivb8wFqG4MyRvHcZuf-4D6nIev3EqOArfWjzNNFo42LALLLjlqteOy5QlszuU8Or0mHwGlbCyuI3EVtlo1mp5JOePU1CKqSP5PJecJqDNoJlOTiznjzYSZc9cDmjZtwwDz2vla52_UIZuVs4a4HOq2c8kTwKt-aTfS71MpiDPMMawgwl5-DXGUfjVz5NVTf4Z3JIp-keLq7e83hs\u003d"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/BPiXg7jtq-o/hqdefault.jpg"]]]],[null,"Baby Panda\u0026#39;s Supermarket is an interactive shopping and role-play game for children aged 3+, developed by BabyBus. Step into a real two-story supermarket with 40+ counters and 300+ products — food, toys, clothing, fruits, cosmetics, and more. Children can play as a cashier, scan items, handle cash and credit card payments, and learn numbers, money concepts, and safe shopping rules while having fun.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e🌟 WHAT MAKES THIS SUPERMARKET SPECIAL\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e【Real Shopping Experience】\u003cbr\u003ePush your cart through 40+ aisles! Follow a shopping list, find products on the right shelves, and check off each item. From Daddy Panda\u0026#39;s birthday cake to school supplies, every trip teaches planning, organization, and responsibility.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e【Cashier Role-Play \u0026amp; Money Skills】\u003cbr\u003eBecome a cashier! Use the cash register, scan barcodes, and accept payments by cash or credit card. Children learn basic math, number recognition, and the value of money — financial literacy made playful.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e【Safety \u0026amp; Good Shopping Habits】\u003cbr\u003eA unique feature: the game teaches safe shopping rules. What happens when a character climbs a shelf, runs with a cart, or jumps the queue? Through vivid scenes and gentle correction, children learn how to behave properly and safely in public spaces.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e【Supermarket Events \u0026amp; DIY Fun】\u003cbr\u003eBeyond shopping, enjoy DIY activities: cook strawberry cakes, make chicken burgers, craft festival masks, and play claw machines and capsule toy machines. Every visit brings something new.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e【Meet Familiar BabyBus Characters】\u003cbr\u003eNearly 10 beloved families — including the Quacky Family and the MeowMi Family — are waiting to shop with you. Interact with friendly characters and create warm shopping stories.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e✨ WHY KIDS \u0026amp; PARENTS LOVE BABY PANDA\u0026#39;S SUPERMARKET\u003cbr\u003e🛒 40+ Counters \u0026amp; 300+ Products — Food, toys, clothing, fruits, cosmetics, daily items\u003cbr\u003e💰 Cash \u0026amp; Credit Card Payment — Learn numbers, money, and basic math through play\u003cbr\u003e🛡️ Safety Education Built In — Correct bad behaviors: climbing, running, queue-jumping\u003cbr\u003e🍰 DIY Activities \u0026amp; Events — Cooking, crafts, claw machines, capsule toys\u003cbr\u003e👨\u200d👩\u200d👧 Near 10 Character Families — Shop with Quacky Family, MeowMi Family, and more\u003cbr\u003e👶 Designed for Ages 3+ — Simple controls, intuitive interface for independent play\u003cbr\u003e📴 Offline Play Supported — No internet needed for travel and quiet time\u003cbr\u003e🔒 COPPA-Compliant \u0026amp; Kid-Safe — A secure, child-friendly environment from BabyBus\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eNote on Content: Baby Panda\u0026#39;s Supermarket offers a generous free library of counters, products, and activities. Some premium items and features may require unlocking. We encourage parents to explore settings together with their child.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eTechnical Requirements: Optimized for Android 10+. Lightweight design for smooth performance. Supports offline play.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eDownload Baby Panda\u0026#39;s Supermarket and let your child\u0026#39;s shopping adventure begin — learning money, safety, and responsibility along the way! 🛒"],"BabyBus","100,000,000+",null,"Ages up to 12",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/QESUjU0m_aLzf8_VPhgJnbg4mSwlcHIxReajVswhbZFpYzQd9hpGKtTZTgimLfkkBTL_u3DRP6kfcI1xi5px8Q"],null,[226,186,196,255]],null,["Rated for 3+",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ"]],null,[null,"In-Game Purchases"],[null,"\u003ca href\u003d\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\u003dappgame_ratings\"\u003eLearn more\u003c/a\u003e"],1,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_re6mcALPaqotePA0WkgYeOQ6TighHRUS62FRmREPEhyZPdGM3QmRjcSpiMt6Pz1O-WZyvEIy4mtGHj9zw"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\u003dappgame_ratings"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,"IDR",""]],null,[null,"Buy"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\u003dcom.sinyee.babybus.shopping\u0026rdid\u003dcom.sinyee.babybus.shopping\u0026feature\u003dmd\u0026offerId"]],null,["CAE\u003d"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],["Install"],null,["CgYKBENBRT0\u003d"]]]],[2],null,[1,1,0],["Rp 10.000 - Rp 64.000 per item",[0]],{"34":[[[["playpass_family",39]]],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,"/store/pass"]]],"101":[null,[[null,2,[1242,2208],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/GX30YAsMK70mWeGbjISUA23QpDZ99Q3nVx19RDk8MHG_y7gWKsCwan6gNdgW0wZP47qUOXuhGWPhew6G1_tqFg"]],[null,2,[1242,2208],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/8ArJebmE40q