Embark on a Culinary Adventure with Kitchen Scramble: Cooking Game! 🍴\u003c/h1\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eJoin \u003cb\u003eChef Pepper\u003c/b\u003e as she takes her \u003cb\u003efood truck\u003c/b\u003e around the globe in this \u003cb\u003eFREE\u003c/b\u003e, highly addictive \u003cb\u003etime-management\u003c/b\u003e and \u003cb\u003ecooking simulation\u003c/b\u003e game. Perfect for adults who love \u003ci\u003ecasual, stress-free gaming\u003c/i\u003e, Kitchen Scramble offers an immersive experience where your \u003cb\u003ekitchen\u003c/b\u003e skills are put to the ultimate test!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ch1\u003e👨\u200d🍳 Why You\u0026#39;ll Love Kitchen Scramble:\u003c/h1\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003e• Become a Star Chef:\u003c/b\u003e Hone your \u003cb\u003ecooking\u003c/b\u003e skills across diverse \u003cb\u003erestaurant\u003c/b\u003e settings and master various \u003cb\u003ecooking\u003c/b\u003e techniques. Serve your \u003cb\u003ecustomers\u003c/b\u003e swiftly to earn high tips or risk losing them if you\u0026#39;re too slow!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003e• Global Food Journey:\u003c/b\u003e Travel city by city around the world, preparing and serving a vast array of \u003cb\u003efood\u003c/b\u003e. Delight your \u003cb\u003ecustomers\u003c/b\u003e with dishes like Eggs Benedict, Szechuan Chicken, Sweet and Sour Shrimp, Pizzas, Hamburgers, and more!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003e• Extensive Menu:\u003c/b\u003e With over \u003cb\u003e1,500 delicious dishes\u003c/b\u003e crafted from \u003cb\u003e280+ high-quality ingredients\u003c/b\u003e, there\u0026#39;s always something new to \u003cb\u003ecook\u003c/b\u003e and serve.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003e• Challenging Time-Management:\u003c/b\u003e Navigate through \u003cb\u003e2,000+ levels\u003c/b\u003e set in \u003cb\u003e80+ unique locations\u003c/b\u003e. Balance speed and accuracy to meet \u003cb\u003ecustomers\u0026#39;\u003c/b\u003e demands under various challenges, including timed levels and minimum score requirements.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003e• Upgrade Your Kitchen:\u003c/b\u003e Enhance your \u003cb\u003ekitchen\u003c/b\u003e with \u003cb\u003e100+ appliances\u003c/b\u003e like coffee makers, rice cookers, pizza ovens, and waffle makers. Upgrades help you manage the \u003cb\u003efood line\u003c/b\u003e more efficiently and expand your \u003cb\u003efood\u003c/b\u003e offerings.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003e• Social Features:\u003c/b\u003e Connect with friends on Facebook to share progress, unlock new locations, and compete on global leaderboards. Ask for help to progress faster and share your culinary achievements on social media!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ch1\u003e🔥 Exciting Features:\u003c/h1\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003e• 1,500+ Dishes:\u003c/b\u003e Cook a wide variety of \u003cb\u003efood\u003c/b\u003e using the best \u003cb\u003eingredients\u003c/b\u003e.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003e• 2,000+ Levels:\u003c/b\u003e Complete challenges in \u003cb\u003e80+ locations\u003c/b\u003e worldwide.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003e• 100+ Upgrades:\u003c/b\u003e Improve your \u003cb\u003ekitchen\u003c/b\u003e appliances to boost efficiency.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003e• Social Connectivity:\u003c/b\u003e Engage with friends, compete globally, and share your success.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003e• Power-ups \u0026amp; Boosters:\u003c/b\u003e Utilize special tools to manage your time and \u003cb\u003ecook\u003c/b\u003e more effectively.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003e• Premium Ingredients:\u003c/b\u003e Use high-quality \u003cb\u003eingredients\u003c/b\u003e to earn bigger tips and satisfy demanding \u003cb\u003ecustomers\u003c/b\u003e.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ch1\u003e🍽️ Join the Cooking Craze!\u003c/h1\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eIf you\u0026#39;re passionate about \u003cb\u003ecooking\u003c/b\u003e, \u003cb\u003ekitchen\u003c/b\u003e management, and \u003cb\u003efood\u003c/b\u003e simulation games, \u003cb\u003eKitchen Scramble\u003c/b\u003e is the perfect match for you. Whether you\u0026#39;re multitasking in a bustling \u003cb\u003efood truck\u003c/b\u003e or perfecting a gourmet meal in a high-end \u003cb\u003erestaurant\u003c/b\u003e, every moment is packed with culinary excitement.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003e🔪 Ready to Cook?\u003c/b\u003e Grab your spatula and start \u003cb\u003emixing\u003c/b\u003e, \u003cb\u003efrying\u003c/b\u003e, and \u003cb\u003esautéing\u003c/b\u003e with Chef Pepper today!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ch1\u003e📥 Download Now for FREE and Start Your Culinary Journey!\u003c/h1\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eStay Connected:\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e• \u003cb\u003eLike us on Facebook:\u003c/b\u003e \u003cfont color\u003d\"blue\"\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"http://www.google.com/url?q\u003dhttp%3A%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2Fkitchenscramble\u0026amp;sa\u003dD\u0026amp;sntz\u003d1\u0026amp;usg\u003dAOvVaw17poX4wHa6rkrF1wenf4N1\"\u003ewww.facebook.com/kitchenscramble\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e• \u003cb\u003eShare your achievements\u003c/b\u003e and \u003cb\u003einvite friends\u003c/b\u003e to join the fun!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eNote:\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e• The game is \u003cb\u003eFREE\u003c/b\u003e with optional in-app purchases to enhance your gameplay. You can disable or limit in-app purchases in your device settings.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e• \u003cb\u003ePush notifications\u003c/b\u003e keep you updated with gifts and new content releases. You can disable them in your device settings if preferred."],"Garden City Games","10,000,000+",null,"",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/1aHAT30hnpSMd-Vl6mCeLbifokpRZHe5c0BStM_lbTHOZQlPV6aHMaLWvZO_r8fwv24qO9E2mY7rihJD3is9"],null,[233,238,235,255]],null,["Rated for 3+",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ"]],null,[null,"Digital Purchases"],[null,"\u003ca href\u003d\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\u003dappgame_ratings\"\u003eLearn more\u003c/a\u003e"],1,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_re6mcALPaqotePA0WkgYeOQ6TighHRUS62FRmREPEhyZPdGM3QmRjcSpiMt6Pz1O-WZyvEIy4mtGHj9zw"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\u003dappgame_ratings"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,"IDR",""]],null,[null,"Buy"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\u003dair.com.kitchenscramble.goo\u0026rdid\u003dair.com.kitchenscramble.goo\u0026feature\u003dmd\u0026offerId"]],null,["CAE\u003d"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],["Install"],null,["CgYKBENBRT0\u003d"]]]],[2],null,[1,1,0],["Rp 16.000 - Rp 1.490.000 per item",[0]],{"101":[null,[[null,2,[1562,2778],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IeHymyY08ZNO59vziw8gNZY_88hOYfzc35WWTn8iQTauZtp6HNkTRk1g3TspDCipLk5Bpd50ICT3-BkBxgZKvA"]],[null,2,[1562,2778],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/7hnVPJYfSpJnq5Cxa1O2q8b0SVZd0ktLZ9JklJ7DDvh3iK7nN2u5ABV-SMYHwq5ULO2vOiTXmGFGuTrgG4uU"]],[null,2,[1562,2778],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/miXwdCttgU7CUoxQWzj30l5vN_cq1flsaEJrmZNrHJNFUairIBl9foyragHcasSDQf-Hw7AkmcsyNVtA39cTQCI"]],[null,2,[1562,2778],[null,null,"https