ull,"Embark on an epic pixel-art quest where every slash brings glorious loot. Build your legend, even while you’re away!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eASSEMBLE GUARDIANS\u003cbr\u003eSummon knights, mages, rogues, and legendary critters. Mix and match to break the meta, evolve your squad, and watch ‘em shred dungeons like paper. No weak links—just absolute units ready to wreck. Your dream team, a tap away.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e AFK BOSS RAIDS\u003cbr\u003eTowering dragons, demon lords, mythical titans—your squad claps ‘em all while you sleep. Wake up to fat stacks of gold, rare gear, and legendary drops. Set it, forget it, and collect loot like a boss. No sweat, no grind—just pure idle profit.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eSWAP STYLES \u0026amp; WEAPONS\u003cbr\u003eSwap weapons on the fly and switch up your hero’s whole vibe. Flaming swords, cursed bows, arcane staves—each loadout brings new moves and fresh drip. Customize your look, flex on mobs, and slay in style that’s all you.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eMEET FELLOW ADVENTURERS\u003cbr\u003eTeam up with real players in a buzzing guild. Chat, share strats, flex your rarest loot, and crush co-op raids together. Lone wolf or party animal, you’ll find your pixel fam and make some epic memories."],"Xdragon Game","100,000+",null,"",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/BaEJYIEVclYMqP2e3nmxMOwWXRb-c8gLDpNE_T8UQkIkC0lgAQKFfht5gao_jDW1lAVeMgltIzwveSxmsbqKmrY"],null,[239,238,238,255]],null,["Rated for 16+",[null,2,[366,512],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/djaflVB_tFGRjZlfs-xrcdSPeI_CUG3TTewlYuSFjq1tsNXxb4aZqAq0uMFzUtiZI_R65RtDyr4Zt2vt"]],[null,"Moderate Violence"],[null,"Users Interact, In-Game Purchases (Includes Random Items)"],[null,"\u003ca href\u003d\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\u003dappgame_ratings\"\u003eLearn more\u003c/a\u003e"],1,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/UAlGNLgnQRVs-XrK_mUGJw1h_nlO1Y