to clear your head, work through your hangover and start your first day as an Operator. There are plenty of cases to solve. Assist our field agents using your computer console and ingenuity to bring criminals to justice. Ready to make the world a better place?\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eInvestigate Crimes: Solve cases such as murders, missing people, and cyber attacks.\u003cbr\u003eUse FDI Software: Analyze evidence and find clues using cutting-edge tools.\u003cbr\u003eDig Deeper: Follow the evidence as it twists and turns, no matter where it leads.\u003cbr\u003eUncover the Truth: Each case is a mind-bending story to unravel, so take notes.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eAssist Our Field Agents\u003cbr\u003eWhen our field agents need support, they\u0026#39;ll call you. Help them by fact-checking, searching databases, identifying killers, and more. Each case will have evidence to evaluate, and it\u0026#39;s your job to dig into documents, connect the clues, and solve the mysteries.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eCutting-Edge Software\u003cbr\u003eYou have the finest FDI software to help with those challenging cases. Tap through the Video and Photo Analyzer, Citizen and Vehicle Database, ChemScan, Notepad and a fully functional Terminal at any point to find out what you need.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eIn Truth, We Seek\u003cbr\u003eTo find the truth, you must follow the evidence and see where it leads, no matter how unsettling. But don\u0026#39;t poke into unauthorized areas without first notifying your superiors.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eFDI\u0026#39;s Most Wanted\u003cbr\u003eWARNING: Any new information on the cyber criminal known as HAL should be reported to your supervisor immediately. For the safety of the general public and your fellow agents, please keep all evidence confidential.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e///// TRUST NO ONE /////\u003cbr\u003e[End Transmission]"],"Bureau 81","500,000+",null,"",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/8e6Pl1D0VbskrVNx4KO6FUsTIVXvIjqK6ZvnzKpRykPHWfuZAndSp-XCDvPiq8DqbObe5usM_g4N92akA-1rFg"],null,[13,17,22,255]],null,["Rated for 12+",[null,2,[366,512],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/yQChfa9XKlaXMIYTk8w8QwChjT8_SH-_2d2SS-kesw0TLQK1nxtw54bDcoZ09freZJgKrtg4f__is-31Vg"]],[null,"Moderate Violence"],[null,"In-Game Purchases"],[null,"\u003ca href\u003d\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\u003dappgame_ratings\"\u003eLearn more\u003c/a\u003e"],1,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/YrkR-GP7OKghBTATCoO_jJrchSVrh-NSUBb5DnbRZC1DbLK_cgV9FC2e_iI4GzLsKXuZjuFZajnGCiA8qA"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\u003dappgame_ratings"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,"IDR",""]],null,[null,"Buy"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\u003dcom.Bureau81.OPERATOR\u0026rdid\u003dcom.Bureau81.OPERATOR\u0026feature\u003dmd\u0026offerId"]],null,["CAE\u003d"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],["Install"],null,["CgYKBENBRT0\u003d"]]]],[2],null,[1,1,0],["Rp 18.000 - Rp 57.000 per item",[0]],{"101":[null,[[null,2,[1287,2288],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/MCHCJkFbnx64qP1JABug2-WpY4JVy9nx01H_LQw7OpmtHmU88bV41-QUOLLGK910ppOMQ8Yg7tON9pqFT3pQ"]],[null,2,[1287,2288],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/fIy6LxGRm-on7FvmgoOq4H9Gs8PDcwM3v_YbOM_LWfSUqsgFT45SuHARY4UaLkSCt5arWPBpEqS9IUPjA9dbFA"]],[null,2,[1287,2288],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/pPWuHxl1jayWXK2Sp_sfc3XbgwITBbpmAKRFWCBfWWvqSi-1XenQqAAdmfQbGUJZp5uSWD9AFM1dSxczIA0t"]],[null,2,[1287,2288],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/chBCE8-vQsNcxE2_1tIfFb0uCz4BZhn7eaJwTXho2-HNTyixepJQf3qXy9bi6n4oxOUdc6ApUOVyiOCjzK480u0"]],[null,2,[1287,2288],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/2aCBzM1jyxhsaCUwAlOTniOsLrYQuxaHGCCvOAMq2i_RfY5r8ZdTEwJeb1RWYmfGEsQjOhRP1shhJWdZGjBGYA4"]],[null,2,[1287,2288],[null,null,"https://play-lh.goo