WgCxoPcIvBT2nZ7rTeP56Xbr_DuxEdAnfEEDFSS1GEDk4s9omhlNSy7ffKZg"]]],"Zomline Survival",["4.8",4.825688],"Strategy",null,null,[null,[[0,"IDR",""]],null,[null,"Buy"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\u003dcom.gtarcade.codeball\u0026rdid\u003dcom.gtarcade.codeball\u0026feature\u003dmd\u0026offerId"]],null,["CAE\u003d"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,"/store/apps/details?id\u003dcom.gtarcade.codeball"]],["\u003d\u003d"],null,[null,"The zombies are coming. Your base is the last line of defense.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eZomline Survival is a fresh mix of zombie strategy, tower defense, and 4X survival gameplay. Build your base, command legendary heroes, expand your territory, and fight back against endless zombie waves in a colorful cartoon apocalypse.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e✅️ DEFEND AGAINST ZOMBIE WAVES\u003cbr\u003eGet ready for fast-paced tower defense battles. Place your defenses and use smart strategy to stop incoming zombie hordes. As enemy waves grow stronger, every choice matters.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e✅️ BUILD, GROW \u0026amp; EXPAND\u003cbr\u003eSurvival takes more than firepower. Gather resources, upgrade buildings, unlock new functions, and strengthen your base. With 4X strategy at its core, Zomline Survival challenges you to balance growth, defense, and expansion while adapting to an ever-changing battlefield.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e✅️ RECRUIT LEGENDARY HEROES\u003cbr\u003eLead a cast of cartoon heroes inspired by famous figures and world civilizations. With distinctive skills, playful designs, and unexpected combat styles, each hero adds personality to your strategy and brings a fresh, unconventional twist to every battle.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e✅️ A FUN TWIST ON THE ZOMBIE APOCALYPSE\u003cbr\u003eBright visuals, stylized characters, and satisfying progression give Zomline Survival a fresh identity. It combines the tension of zombie survival with the depth of a strategy game and the action of tower defense.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e✅️ SURVIVE TOGETHER\u003cbr\u003eConnect with players worldwide, exchange strategies, and work together to survive the zombie apocalypse. Build alliances, support your teammates, and face the chaos of the wasteland as a united force.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eDownload now and build your defense in the zombie apocalypse!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e[Stay Connected]\u003cbr\u003eFB: https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id\u003d61554858010591\u003cbr\u003eDiscord: https://discord.gg/Cf8ysNXk7S"],"Yoozoo (Singapore) Pte. Ltd","500,000+",null,"",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/YoxsbzqnsUE28Z1HgqpQehf9UN_or48cY4ocUv6d28cGveLFQemR1PWAtU2q0IXNcSAbKDnlOrhPXmiagDFJng"],null,[78,87,90,255]],null,["Rated for 16+",[null,2,[366,512],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/djaflVB_tFGRjZlfs-xrcdSPeI_CUG3TTewlYuSFjq1tsNXxb4aZqAq0uMFzUtiZI_R65RtDyr4Zt2vt"]],null,[null,"Users Interact, In-Game Purchases (Includes Random Items)"],[null,"\u003ca href\u003d\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\u003dappgame_ratings\"\u003eLearn more\u003c/a\u003e"],1,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/UAlGNLgnQRVs-XrK_mUGJw1h_nlO1Ykv0jZK-YoRrRYIGIWmRdE_CCPB7U34jAiz4xLWUAqQ5Me7Daq7N_8"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\u003dappgame_ratings"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,"IDR",""]],null,[null,"Buy"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\u003dcom.gtarcade.codeball\u0026rdid\u003dcom.gtarcade.codeball\u0026feature\u003dmd\u0026offerId"]],null,["CAE\u003d"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],["Install"],null,["CgYKBENBRT0\u003d"]]]],[2],null,[1,1,0],["Rp 19.500 - Rp 1.999.000 per item",[0]],{"101":[null,[[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/WrdYWIw8I-XC5YoZpVNtOMhEm5t59rD-feT0UjGYnwjlVbgug