8npgUbbOnP6IynIV6eSJ4cHI_D4ywZizRyh3z9Ja3C22jc8wJ2tuoHf-fKQ6qQ"]],[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/4s25wVA1oIxfH1IJFYp-gDrekyfeibqU7rGi4Hc5NnwQlyFNG2MEuviKX4FM9had2wwk1Qr0rMR536729oZhgQ"],null,[248,224,206,255]]],"Goods Factory Sorting - Match",["4.8",4.767857],"Puzzle",null,null,[null,[[0,"IDR",""]],null,[null,"Buy"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\u003dcom.match.goodsfactory.sort\u0026rdid\u003dcom.match.goodsfactory.sort\u0026feature\u003dmd\u0026offerId"]],null,["CAE\u003d"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,"/store/apps/details?id\u003dcom.match.goodsfactory.sort"]],[""],null,[null,"Get ready for a satisfying goods sorting adventure in Goods Factory Sorting - Match 3D!\u003cbr\u003e Dive into a relaxing yet challenging 3D sorting puzzle game where you organize shelves, match identical goods, and clear cluttered stacks. Experience the fun of triple match gameplay, strategic sorting, and satisfying organization in a colorful factory world.\u003cbr\u003eIf you love sorting games, match 3 puzzles, organizing shelves, and relaxing matching challenges, this addictive goods sorting match 3D game is perfect for you!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e🧩 Addictive Goods Sorting Gameplay\u003cbr\u003eEnjoy the classic sorting puzzle gameplay with a fun twist!\u003cbr\u003e Tap and match three identical goods to remove them from the shelf. Carefully organize items and plan your moves to complete each level in this satisfying match 3D puzzle experience.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e🏭 Hundreds of Challenging Sorting Levels\u003cbr\u003eTest your skills across hundreds of exciting levels filled with different goods and layouts.\u003cbr\u003e As the levels progress, the puzzles become more challenging, requiring smarter sorting strategies and matching skills.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e✨ Powerful Boosters \u0026amp; Helpful Tools\u003cbr\u003eStuck on a difficult puzzle? Use powerful boosters and power-ups to clear goods faster, remove obstacles, and complete tricky levels. These tools make your sorting and matching journey even more exciting!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e🛍️ Variety of Goods to Sort \u0026amp; Match\u003cbr\u003eDiscover a huge collection of everyday goods to organize — snacks, drinks, toys, fruits, and more. Each level brings new items to sort, making every puzzle fresh and engaging.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eHow to Play\u003cbr\u003e- Tap goods to move them onto the shelf. \u003cbr\u003e- Match three identical items to clear them. \u003cbr\u003e- Organize and sort goods carefully to avoid running out of space. \u003cbr\u003e- Use boosters and power-ups to overcome tricky puzzles. \u003cbr\u003e- Complete levels to unlock more exciting sorting challenges.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eReady to become a master of goods sorting?\u003cbr\u003e Download Goods Factory Sorting - Match 3D now and enjoy the satisfying fun of sorting, organizing, and matching puzzles anytime!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eSeeking help? Please contact us at：ouroboros_cs@outlook.com. We are always at your service!"],"Ouroboros Technology Pte. Ltd","100,000+",null,"",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/4s25wVA1oIxfH1IJFYp-gDrekyfeibqU7rGi4Hc5NnwQlyFNG2MEuviKX4FM9had2wwk1Qr0rMR536729oZhgQ"],null,[248,224,206,255]],null,["Rated for 3+",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ"]],null,[null,"In-Game Purchases"],[null,"\u003ca href\u003d\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\u003dappgame_ratings\"\u003eLearn more\u003c/a\u003e"],1,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_re6mcALPaqotePA0WkgYeOQ6TighHRUS62FRmREPEhyZPdGM3QmRjcSpiMt6Pz1O-WZyvEIy4mtGHj9zw"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\u003dappg