ull,[null,null,"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/VDC2f7H8TQI/hqdefault.jpg"]]]],[null,"Oh, Snack! What\u0026#39;s your high score? Aim, fling, and hop into other food and objects to climb your way to the window. Every body moves differently, so when one jump won’t work, steal a better body. Build combos, reach toasts, dodge kitchen hazards, and escape before the kitchen gets you.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eFeatures:\u003cbr\u003e• Drag to aim, release to hop!\u003cbr\u003e• Possess food and objects with unique physics. Each body feels different.\u003cbr\u003e• Chain hops for combos and a higher climb score.\u003cbr\u003e• Reach checkpoints to save your session progress.\u003cbr\u003e• Leaderboard and achievements.\u003cbr\u003e• Accessibility and comfort features."],"Tepes Ovidiu","10,000+",null,"All ages",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/VjW0cihCAgK03Ot9a2YUBH2CRM7CJiOaP0Q1blk2XbjC3RNHYuwxvC4YzEGI5bXBLVL-iYhYB4MG-fJQBNJw"],null,[242,170,37,255]],null,["Rated for 3+",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ"]],null,null,[null,"\u003ca href\u003d\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\u003dappgame_ratings\"\u003eLearn more\u003c/a\u003e"],1,[null,"Suitable for all age groups. Some violence in a comical or fantasy context is acceptable. Bad language is not permitted."],[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_re6mcALPaqotePA0WkgYeOQ6TighHRUS62FRmREPEhyZPdGM3QmRjcSpiMt6Pz1O-WZyvEIy4mtGHj9zw"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\u003dappgame_ratings"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,"IDR",""]],null,[null,"Buy"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\u003dcom.crevasse.ohsnack\u0026rdid\u003dcom.crevasse.ohsnack\u0026feature\u003dmd\u0026offerId"]],null,["CAE\u003d"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],["In