\u003dlarge\u0026rel\u003d0\u0026autohide\u003d1\u0026showinfo\u003d0"],"yt:movie:BBjMO0HtKbs",null,null,null,null,"AXH1ezn2lpgJ2zFL_rsxf0d-WCiTwrCm_nSsNvT4fg7MTGxSO_iZ-TfJPD2dJgToFrAHUHjJwTC1YPaFFnm4SId0_LExCFB956X2l5ifyh-ey_vT3BenzQnr4wMXJV606DZXeK_mjQt5mJe7ah19uDNHmodwB3KOSFehdKsIsR-qwEZfuNiz527MxYOJASP_c6OkrnILeiYEzYunNW7LhHLrU25D66IHmD9Y25o32JAjKBLaoRBLALq71x1WfVQ9Xa4NDl66ZPZZDjFAH4Cz2kAbtngnkLTkWY1Czwo1AZGhYOw\u003d"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/BBjMO0HtKbs/hqdefault.jpg"]]]],[null,"Pack your camera and set off right now! Welcome to the healing travel world of \u0026quot;[Dream Match].\u0026quot;.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eHere, you will take on the role of a brilliant yet stuck-at-a-junction top-tier designer. To reclaim lost creative inspiration, you decide to set aside the heavy workload and embark on a spontaneous global road trip in that old car that has been your companion for years!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eAre you ready to embrace this healing journey filled with laughter, friendship, and breathtaking beauty?\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e【Game Features】\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003ePuzzle matching game for stress relief\u003cbr\u003eClassic yet highly creative match-3 levels await your challenge! Swipe your fingertips to unleash dazzling elimination effects and collect power-ups in a relaxing, upbeat rhythm. Whether you\u0026#39;re a seasoned match-3 veteran or a casual player, you\u0026#39;ll find plenty of rewarding moments here.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eGlobal Travel, Collecting Amazing Photo Albums\u003cbr\u003eSunshine, sand, bonfires, starry skies... The game features over a dozen exquisitely designed scenes with diverse styles. In each meticulously arranged scene, find the perfect angle to capture the most flawless travel postcard. Continuously enrich your travel album and witness the protagonist\u0026#39;s journey of rediscovering creative inspiration.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eNo internet required, play anytime, anywhere\u003cbr\u003eFully supports offline play, so no need to worry about data usage or signal! You can quickly complete a round in just a few minutes, picking up and putting down whenever you want. Perfectly fills your fragmented time, serving as your pocket-sized stress relief haven.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eLife is not just about the mundane present, but also about poetry and the distant memories in an album.\u003cbr\u003eDownload \u0026quot;[Dream Match]\u0026quot; now and join us on this healing journey to discover beauty and inspiration!"],"LETS FUN - publisher of match 3 puzzle game","50,000+",null,"",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/qhB7iqMDC2iy28leI4qSL1JpnS1Z-gTZNMvvGRCNlbma5XnHw1bIkxF0TlZlzgqOXVGSWj6v_v32Xu29Y7wmtnM"],null,[254,219,133,255]],null,["Rated for 3+",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ"]],null,[null,"Users Interact, In-Game Purchases"],[null,"\u003ca href\u003d\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\u003dappgame_ratings\"\u003eLearn more\u003c/a\u003e"],1,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_re6mcALPaqotePA0WkgYeOQ6TighHRUS62FRmREPEhyZPdGM3QmRjcSpiMt6Pz1O-WZyvEIy4mtGHj9zw"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\u003dappgame_ratings"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,"IDR",""]],null,[null,"Buy"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\u003dcom.letsfun.game.dreammatch\u0026rdid\u003dcom.letsfun.game.dreammatch\u0026feature\u003dmd\u0026offerId"]],null,["CAE\u003d"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],["Install"],null,["CgYKBENBRT0\u003d"]]]],[2],null,[1,1,0],["Rp 18.000 - Rp 1.790.000 per item",[0]],{"101":[null,[[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/ttyVTxDpW9T3EAZqQnrTK9jWKkr5pUCRTopZQXuTKW4UmW_sfd9DRsReOrYQjLap_5HRAFH0N0